{"memo": "Award Recommendation: Voltara Power Systems Pvt. Ltd.

Voltara is recommended for award at a leveled total of $1,068,250, which is 1.8% below the next-ranked bidder. Voltara's stated total of $994,000 was not the lowest received; Helix Switchgear Co. stated $991,500. However, the stated totals are not comparable as submitted. To level the bids, Voltara's unpriced scope items were plugged: freight to site (DDP) $20,500, offloading and rigging at site $15,250, startup and commissioning $29,000, and seismic certification $9,500. Helix's stated total also carries an arithmetic error (line items sum to $1,004,500 vs. stated $991,500) and required plugs for an integral surge protective device (SPD) $39,500, arc flash and coordination study $19,500, spare parts $15,000, and seismic certification $9,500.

Before award, Voltara must clear the following conditions: confirm DDP site pricing in place of FOB factory, Pune; accept a 24-month warranty (its offer is 18 months from shipment); and agree to payment terms (its offer is 20% with order, 70% on shipment, 10% on energization). Its 34-week lead time should be noted."}
